      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ANJO PRINCESS (1) has a strong record this trip with six wins and two placings from 10 starts. Recorded a 0.8 lengths win (18.21) in a Grade 5 last time at this track. Looks suited and should go close. ROGUE AGENT (2) was well fancied last time on the strength of her recent form but could only manage second (23.23) at this track. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings four times from five starts. Leading chance. ANJO TOPAZ (7) is a fast dog well performed over the sprint races. Kept coming to finish fifth over 320m at this track (18.78) latest in a Grade 4/5. Solid record here at this trip including seven wins. The form from her last run is stacking up nicely. Should play a prominent role. RED ROCK ALONG (3) can improve on an unplaced run here last time out.",
